   "t": "p",
   "html": "Extremely sensitive as with the stock coil and slightly deeper than the stock coil, weight is not and issue although heavier than the stock coil a slight front heavy detector it now becomes, superb for clean sites and able to run at maximum sensitivity, but i am still going through settings to make this work out better for trashy beaches."
